    "국사편찬위원회가 수집한 미국 자료 가운데 NARA에서 수집한 자료들에 대해 사료군, 사료계열별로 자료의 전체상을 소개하고 있는 책자이다. 전자도서관 간행도서 원문서비스 (http://library.history.go.kr/dhrs/dhrsXIFViewer.jsp?system=dlidb&id=000000266932)를 통해 원문을 확인할 수 있다. <차례> 간행사Ⅰ. 사업소개  1. 국외 소재 한국관련 자료 수집ㆍ이전 사업 ············································ 1  2. 미주 지역 수집자료의 대강 ···································································· 7  3. 국사편찬위원회 전자사료관의 자료분류체계 ··········································14Ⅱ. 미 국립문서기록관리청(NARA) 수집자료 ················································· 23【1】Record Group 306：Records of the U.S. Information Agency,1900~2003 ··························································································· 25【2】Record Group 59：General Records of the Department of State,1763~2002 ··························································································· 52【3】Record Group 84：Records of the Foreign Service Posts of theDepartment of State, 1788~1964 ······················································· 105【4】Record Group 338：Records of U.S. Army Operational, Tactical andSupport Organizations(World War Ⅱ and Thereafter), 1917~1993 ··· 112【5】Record Group 111：Records of the Office of the Chief Signal Officer,1860~1985 ·························································································· 160【6】Record Group 319：Records of the Army Staff, 1903~2009 ················· 175【7】Record Group 313：Records of Naval Operating Forces, 1849~1997 ·· 204【8】Record Group 38：Records of the Office of the Chief of NavalOperations, 1875~2006 ······································································ 212【9】Record Group 469：Records of U.S. Foreign Assistance Agencies,1942~1963 ························································································· 216【10】CIA Records Search Tool(CREST) ··················································· 252【11】IWG Reference Collection ································································ 253【12】Selected Copies fr